{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51512","headline":"恭州界（旧《图经》及《寰宇记》、《九域志》皆日渝州，《舆地广记》曰恭州。） · 司空图","name":"恭州界（旧《图经》及《寰宇记》、《九域志》皆日渝州，《舆地广记》曰恭州。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山容地脉本清凉，不解爲霖却作汤。\n草木龟鱼困薰煮，漫赢尘垢涴僧坊。\n（《舆地纪胜》一七五《重庆府》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}